<title>USA: TABLE - Novellus Systems Inc Q2 results.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Novellus Systems Inc Q2 results.</headline>
<dateline>SAN JOSE, Calif. 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>NOVELLUS SYSTEMS INC.</p>
<p>		CONDENSED CONSOLIDATED STATEMENTS OF INCOME</p>
<p>		 (in thousands, except per share amounts)</p>
