<p>NOTE:  Q2 1997 net loss included total one-time pre-tax charges of $235.2 million. Without charges, the second quarter of 1997 would have shown net income of $17.2 million or $1.00 per share.</p>
<p>In Q2 1997 in connection with the acquisition of the PVD division of Varian Associates Inc., Novellus took an aggregate one-time pre-tax charge of $133.5 million.</p>
<p>Other one-time charges in the second quarter included charges attributable to the write-off of $17.7 million owing from Submicron Technology Inc. In addition, charges totalling $84.0 million were incurred in conjunction with the previously announced settlement of Applied Materials patent litigation.</p>
